### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

### Create One
POST http://localhost:8080/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "new title 3",
  "content": "new content 3",
  "author": "author 3"
}

### Create Post-Tag 중요
POST http://localhost:8080/posts/1/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "java"
}


### find All
GET http://localhost:8080/posts
Content-Type: application/json

### find One V1
GET http://localhost:8080/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

### find One V2
GET http://localhost:8080/posts/v2/1
Content-Type: application/json

### find One With Count Comment
GET http://localhost:8080/posts/1/count-comment
Content-Type: application/json

### Find All With Count Comment
GET http://localhost:8080/posts/count-comment
